---
// src/pages/refunds.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Policy – Jyotish Consultations"
  description="Our refund and cancellation policy for astrology, numerology, and Vastu consultation services."
  ogImage="/refunds-og.jpg"
>
  <article class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      
      <header style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <p class="section-eyebrow mb-2">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="section-title mb-3">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
        <hr class="gold-divider" />
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-top: 16px;">Last Updated: January 2025</p>
      </header>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">Overview</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          We understand that circumstances may change. This policy outlines our refund and cancellation procedures to ensure fairness for both our clients and practitioners.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px; background: #ECFDF5; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #10B981;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">✓ Full Refund Eligibility</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 12px;">You are eligible for a full refund if:</p>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>You cancel at least 24 hours before your scheduled appointment</li>
          <li>The consultant cancels or reschedules your session</li>
          <li>Technical issues prevent the consultation from occurring (on our end)</li>
          <li>You have not used any part of the consultation service</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px; margin-top: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">Cancellation Timeline</h2>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 16px 0 12px; color: var(--color-voltage-violet);">More than 24 hours before appointment</h3>
          <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);"><strong>100% refund</strong> – Full amount refunded to original payment method within 5-7 business days.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 16px 0 12px; color: var(--color-voltage-violet);">Within 24 hours of appointment</h3>
          <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);"><strong>50% refund</strong> – Half of the consultation fee refunded. The remaining 50% is retained as a cancellation fee to compensate for the reserved time slot.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 16px 0 12px; color: var(--color-voltage-violet);">Less than 2 hours or No-Show</h3>
          <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);"><strong>No refund</strong> – No refund will be provided for cancellations made less than 2 hours before the appointment or if you do not attend the scheduled session.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">Rescheduling Policy</h2>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li><strong>Free rescheduling:</strong> You may reschedule your appointment once without charge if done at least 24 hours in advance</li>
          <li><strong>Additional rescheduling:</strong> Subsequent rescheduling requests may incur a ₹200 administrative fee</li>
          <li><strong>Last-minute rescheduling:</strong> Requests within 24 hours will be treated as cancellations and subject to cancellation fees</li>
          <li><strong>Consultant-initiated rescheduling:</strong> If we need to reschedule, you may choose a new slot at no extra cost or receive a full refund</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">Quick Consultation Refunds</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          For Quick Consultation services (email-based):
        </p>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li><strong>Before submission:</strong> Full refund if you request before submitting your questions</li>
          <li><strong>After submission:</strong> No refund once questions have been submitted, as the consultant begins work immediately</li>
          <li><strong>Non-response:</strong> Full refund if you do not receive a response within 48 hours</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">Non-Refundable Situations</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">Refunds will not be provided in the following cases:</p>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>Dissatisfaction with the guidance provided (consultations are for guidance only)</li>
          <li>Disagreement with astrological interpretations or predictions</li>
          <li>Failure to provide accurate birth details affecting the reading</li>
          <li>Not attending the session at the scheduled time (no-show)</li>
          <li>Technical issues on the client's end (poor internet, device problems)</li>
          <li>Services already fully rendered and completed</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">How to Request a Refund</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          To request a refund or cancellation:
        </p>
        <ol style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>Email us at <strong>support@jyotish.example.com</strong></li>
          <li>Include your booking reference number and name</li>
          <li>Specify whether you want a refund or rescheduling</li>
          <li>Provide a brief reason for the cancellation (optional)</li>
        </ol>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);">
          We will process your request within 24 hours and confirm via email.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">Refund Processing Time</h2>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li><strong>Credit/Debit Cards:</strong> 5-7 business days</li>
          <li><strong>UPI:</strong> 3-5 business days</li>
          <li><strong>Net Banking:</strong> 5-7 business days</li>
          <li><strong>Wallets:</strong> 2-4 business days</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);">
          The actual credit time depends on your bank or payment provider.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          If you have a dispute regarding a refund:
        </p>
        <ol style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>Contact our support team first at support@jyotish.example.com</li>
          <li>Provide all relevant details and documentation</li>
          <li>We will investigate and respond within 48 hours</li>
          <li>If unresolved, disputes will be handled as per Indian consumer protection laws</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light);">
          We reserve the right to modify this Refund Policy at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to the website. Please review this page periodically for updates.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="background: var(--color-porcelain-white); padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-midnight-ink);">Need Help?</h2>
        <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-charcoal-light); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Our support team is here to assist you with any questions about refunds or cancellations.
        </p>
        <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-voltage-violet);">
          Email: support@jyotish.example.com<br />
          Response Time: Within 24 hours
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
